## Your verdict line

The last line of your findings is this, and nothing follows it:

```
VERDICT: critical=<n> warning=<n> note=<n>
```

Single spaces exactly as shown, lowercase keys, plain integers, no trailing text. The three numbers count the findings you just wrote, each finding falling under exactly one severity — they are counts of findings, not of files, sections, or sentences.

The line is the closing line of the findings document itself, not a note beside it. You decide what is critical.
